### 2. Specialist Engine & Baseline Ladder

#### [NEW] [precipitation_specialist.py](file:///c:/Users/adity/OneDrive/Desktop/SIH26079-RII/backend/app/builder2/precipitation_specialist.py)
- `PrecipitationReliabilitySpecialist`:
  - Implements the complete baseline ladder:
    1. Climatology baseline (historical seasonal/regional rain frequency)
    2. Raw ensemble baseline (spread-based uncertainty)
    3. Spread-to-bust logistic regression
    4. V3 incumbent + precipitation thermodynamic/kinematic features
    5. Continuous error distribution estimator (Gaussian / log-normal parameters)
    6. Heavy-rain specialist (calibrated for high-impact tails >64.5mm)
    7. Sequence/spatial challenger
  - Integrates into `ReliabilityState` with hazard curves, survival curves, and recovery dynamics.
  - OOD detection and selective prediction abstention logic.

